# A Fate Decided (CoP 8-2): Ixghrah's death at Status 2 and _iya. _iyq spawns Ixghrah (7375); a GM sets Status 2;
# his death leaves Status 2 (it moves only 0 to 1); _iyq: NOTHING_LEFT_TO_DO (7378, the default; Status 2 has no
# reply). _iya at Status 2 and 1: DOES_NOT_RESPOND (7259, 8-2's own message).
lists GrandPalaceOfHuxzoi/_iya/onTrigger GrandPalaceOfHuxzoi/_iyq/onTrigger
char zone=GrandPalaceOfHuxzoi pos=420,-1,396 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop AFateDecided current
login
trigger _iyq                            # Ixghrah spawned: 7375
charvar Mission[6][818]Status 2         # a GM
kill IXGHRAH                            # Status 2 stays
trigger _iyq                            # 7378 (the default)
finish-if-event
trigger _iya                            # 7259
finish-if-event
charvar Mission[6][818]Status 1         # a GM
trigger _iya                            # 7259
finish-if-event
